        {"number":1,"text":"Field Notes Service Guide","bounds":{"page":0,"x":73.818,"y":719.784,"w":210.33002,"h":14.76001},"fontSize":18.0,"heading":true},
        {"number":2,"text":"Field Notes is a fictional note-taking service used to test how paragraphs are extracted from PDF files. Notes can be shared with co-operating teams, and every account has a support code such as 123-456 printed on the invoice.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":72.22,"y":640.092,"w":369.85294,"h":57.739014},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":3,"text":"Before installing, check that your device has at least 2 GB of free space - (see the table in the appendix) and a stable network connection.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":73.012,"y":601.292,"w":363.26395,"h":26.939026},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":4,"text":"Installation","bounds":{"page":0,"x":73.414,"y":582.232,"w":71.75,"h":11.4800415},"fontSize":14.0,"heading":true},
        {"number":5,"text":"• Download the installer from the example site.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":76.334,"y":560.292,"w":241.50502,"h":11.539001},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":6,"text":"• Run the installer and follow the steps on the screen. The setup may take a few minutes on older devices.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":76.334,"y":531.868,"w":351.28497,"h":24.56305},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":7,"text":"(a) Sign in with your account.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":73.012,"y":513.86096,"w":147.048,"h":11.869019},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":8,"text":"1) Choose the folders to sync.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":72.968,"y":498.63702,"w":148.324,"h":11.692993},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":9,"text":"The service keeps deleted notes for thirty days. After that, they are removed permanently and cannot be restored by the support team.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":73.012,"y":459.837,"w":358.798,"h":26.993988},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":10,"text":"Backups are created every night.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":95.111,"y":444.261,"w":165.20901,"h":11.627014},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":11,"text":"Contact the support team at support@example.com if you need help with your account.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":72.143,"y":413.63702,"w":397.75992,"h":26.993988},"fontSize":11.0,"heading":false},
        {"number":12,"text":"All names in this guide are fictional.","bounds":{"page":0,"x":72.032,"y":398.80798,"w":131.23198,"h":8.559998},"fontSize":8.0,"heading":false}
      ]
    }
  },
  {
